```
Reason:
The original implementation incorrectly defined the `capacity` parameter as the maximum size of each sub-queue, leading to a misunderstanding of how the total capacity was distributed among the sub-queues. This caused the combined size of the sub-queues to exceed the configured total capacity.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
