*   Notes: Each sub-queue has a capacity of `capacity / numSubqueues`.
*   The first or the highest priority sub-queue has an excess capacity
*   of `capacity % numSubqueues`
```
Reason:
The patch corrects the definition of `capacity` to represent the total size of all sub-queues, and it clarifies how the capacity is distributed among the sub-queues. This ensures that the first sub-queue can accommodate the excess capacity without exceeding the overall configured limit, thus properly enforcing the total capacity of the FairCallQueue.


